{"seq":2,"slug":"public-administration","title":"公共管理","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration","introMarkdown":"# 公共管理 简介\n\n公共管理研究政府和公共组织如何制定政策、配置资源和提供公共服务。与企业管理追求利润不同，公共管理的目标是公共利益的最大化——如何让有限的财政资金产生最大的社会效益，如何在多元利益诉求之间找到平衡，如何让政策从纸面上的方案变成公众能感受到的实际改善。\n\n自学公共管理需要一种特殊的视角切换能力。你既要理解韦伯式官僚制的运作逻辑，也要看到新公共管理运动对效率的追求，还要思考公共价值理论提出的更深层的合法性问题。这三种视角并非相互替代，而是帮助你从不同侧面理解公共部门的复杂现实。\n\n本学习空间将公共管理的核心知识组织为四个章节。**第一章 公共管理理论** 梳理从传统官僚治理到新公共管理再到公共价值理论的演进脉络，帮助你建立分析公共组织行为的理论工具箱。**第二章 公共政策学** 深入政策的全生命周期，从问题识别和方案设计，到执行落地和效果评估，理解\"好政策\"从何而来。**第三章 政府管理** 聚焦政府运作的关键维度，包括财政管理、人力资源管理和电子政务建设。**第四章 非营利组织管理** 将视野拓展到政府之外，探讨非政府组织的治理、社会企业的运营以及公共服务创新的新模式。\n\n建议在学习时密切关注身边的公共事务——一项交通政策的出台、一次社区治理的改进——尝试用所学的理论去分析其中的决策逻辑和利益博弈，这是理解公共管理最直接的方式。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"public-admin-theory","title":"公共管理理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-admin-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"urban-planning","title":"大学公共管理 — 城市规划","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-admin-theory/urban-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"public-services","title":"大学公共管理 — 公共服务","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-admin-theory/public-services"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crisis-management","title":"大学公共管理 — 危机管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-admin-theory/crisis-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"public-policy","title":"公共政策学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"policy-analysis","title":"大学公共管理 — 政策分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-policy/policy-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-implementation","title":"大学公共管理 — 政策执行","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-policy/policy-implementation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-evaluation","title":"大学公共管理 — 政策评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-policy/policy-evaluation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"government-management","title":"政府管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/government-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bureaucratic-theory","title":"大学公共管理 — 官僚制理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/government-management/bureaucratic-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"e-government","title":"大学公共管理 — 电子政务","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/government-management/e-government"},{"seq":3,"slug":"public-finance","title":"大学公共管理 — 公共财政","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/government-management/public-finance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"non-profit-management","title":"非营利组织管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/non-profit-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ngo-governance","title":"大学公共管理 — 非营利组织治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/non-profit-management/ngo-governance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-entrepreneurship","title":"大学公共管理 — 社会创业","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/non-profit-management/social-entrepreneurship"},{"seq":3,"slug":"philanthropy","title":"大学公共管理 — 慈善事业","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/non-profit-management/philanthropy"}]}]}